{"group_identity":"6673f06f1ad53311c989c690b3184c0011e7b892754e3c652f10c69c4f8556a5","payload":{"attempt":1,"contract":"translation_surface_screen_v1_lane_group","cycle":0,"group_id":"group-000","lane_boundaries":[{"index":1,"length":20,"offset":0},{"index":2,"length":20,"offset":20},{"index":3,"length":20,"offset":40},{"index":4,"length":20,"offset":60}],"lane_count":4,"lanes":[{"candidate_identity":"cc64d553f24b8b0e212cdd6e7f7c8a3f209419a5d53041f84c9cdddfdbdaffd5","dispatch_id":"lane-000-0","index":1,"input_path":".ai/task/batch-e75079d31ed621c7f849/SURFACE-SCREEN-ENVELOPE-lane-000-0.json"},{"candidate_identity":"02cc7c036484b546ca87eec0f8c13bafc631da7e2dad97280495006b299f6433","dispatch_id":"lane-000-1","index":2,"input_path":".ai/task/batch-e75079d31ed621c7f849/SURFACE-SCREEN-ENVELOPE-lane-000-1.json"},{"candidate_identity":"0e3f0040ff53c7fc821fdfddf2fbaf6ea7e436ff39d0cb97427ae7f318463d25","dispatch_id":"lane-000-2","index":3,"input_path":".ai/task/batch-e75079d31ed621c7f849/SURFACE-SCREEN-ENVELOPE-lane-000-2.json"},{"candidate_identity":"9b3fa022d05c7e9c2c63dacb54a45a4f36da1381bfca7b1e9654940c25915abd","dispatch_id":"lane-000-3","index":4,"input_path":".ai/task/batch-e75079d31ed621c7f849/SURFACE-SCREEN-ENVELOPE-lane-000-3.json"}],"review_phase":"REVIEW","task_id":"batch-e75079d31ed621c7f849","workset":{"entries":[{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"e39dbac907e90fdc9e61370dc323ef5cdaf03baff9df183b9b89c9af81a555f8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"169e495338b1db6a9615e27a887544e31e03fb93a1c71b4cd22aebd9219b34c4","logical_entry_identity":"eb8edb64170b99c93281d6cd90a27c65adb22460be202f62bd43016ef1bc02e5","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A strong body is key to a strong mind, and a strong mind can be powerful enough to make a strong body.\n\t\tThis prodigy grants a Mindpower bonus equal to 60%% of your Strength.\n\t\tAdditionally, you treat all weapons as having an additional 40%% Willpower modifier.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"强壮的身体才能承载强大的精神。而强大的精神却可以创造一个强壮的身体。\n\t\t获得相当于你 60%% 力量值的精神强度增益。\n\t\t此外，你的所有武器都会有额外的 40%% 意志修正加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"64636bf4fa46cb978c4999e97b14bb864b3ab08365086139af1097afcab6309d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"227be381cb4b4e25a22d1469fd12fdb24c3577c46aee126b0639fdc01a4a1024","logical_entry_identity":"d4d367d7b69c3978e97ccc83bf8bab8a327df7ca512f807b71045a38216b1dbe","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Your melee and ranged attacks inflict distracting wounds that reduce the target’s critical strike multiplier by %d%% for 5 turns. \nIn addition, your attacks have a %d%% chance to inflict a painful wound that causes them to forget a random talent for %d turns.  The last effect cannot occur more than once per turn per target.\n\t\t","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你的近战和远程攻击制造的伤口会使敌人分心，使目标的暴击系数减少 %d%%，持续 5 回合。\n\t\t此外，你的攻击还有 %d%% 的几率造成痛苦的创伤，使敌人随机遗忘一项技能，持续 %d 回合。这一效果对每个目标每回合最多触发一次。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"770f388038e569ddff0e19f0e84c7b079313f9d8f417e1b8f10c69f7e6c014f6","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"3535ea642c0ac802cbedecca175a1196f28728b56d6c5f331c9d0fb65a8c98ba","logical_entry_identity":"dd6f582106e74b38f6c6390deddb4de7dccbc14435f46114c2887e358b98a187","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Hate-powered abilities that don't belong anywhere else.","source_tag":"_t","target":"由仇恨驱动、无法归入其他类别的各项能力。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b48bd358f0daf2c5094a44bdd6c42fa56cecc287615707c38cd9d7e776d0fa26","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"5beefe9d8a6077fc19615c3addd26a774dba014b784a22ba46a24ff7ee1b33c5","logical_entry_identity":"47a69cc1822533c2c43fb1032c75e0e4ecf48f56a8b3e9fef99c2a7a89681e2e","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#{italic}#From the notes of Darwood Oakton, explorer:\n#{bold}#CHAPTER ONE: THE SHER'TUL\n\n#{normal}#The Sher'Tul. Who were they? Where did they come from? Where did they go? The mysteries surrounding this ancient race are almost infinite. What little scraps of information we have regarding them allude to a mighty and world-spanning civilisation, wielding power and magic unthinkable. Now, however, all that remains of them are forgotten, wind-swept ruins, the tiniest minutiae of their technology sealed away in the studies of reclusive sages. Does their mystery not call to your curious nature as it does mine, gentle reader?\n\nMy quest has drawn me into the Old Forest. What is there to be said about a place like \"the old forest\"? It is a forest, and it is old. By its unimaginative moniker you can guess how important this place is to the people of Derth; the only locals who commonly venture under its boughs are novice alchemists in search of ingredients, plus the odd hunter with his sights set low. However, the story of this old forest now takes a more interesting twist...\n\nRumours are growing of trees roaming in its depths, moving as you or I would. Some even claim that they now possess the spark of sentience. The Sher'Tul were rumoured to hold the power of animism... is this mere coincidence?","source_tag":"_t","target":"#{italic}#摘自探险家达沃德·欧卡顿的笔记：\n#{bold}#第一章：夏·图尔\n\n#{normal}#夏·图尔。他们是谁？从何而来？又去了哪里？围绕这个古老种族的谜团几乎无穷无尽。我们掌握的寥寥资料，只隐约指向一个强盛而遍及世界的文明，他们驾驭着难以想象的力量与魔法。然而如今，他们只剩下遭人遗忘、饱受风蚀的废墟；其技术最细微的片段，也被封存在离群索居的贤者书斋中。亲爱的读者，他们的谜团是否也像呼唤我一样，唤起了你的好奇心？\n\n我的探寻将我带进了古老森林。对于一个叫作“古老森林”的地方，还能说些什么？它是一片森林，而且很古老。只看这毫无新意的名字，你就能猜到德斯人有多么重视这里：当地经常走入林荫之下的，只有寻找材料的新手炼金术师，外加偶尔几个志向不高的猎人。不过，这片古老森林的故事如今有了更有趣的转折……\n\n越来越多的传言声称，森林深处的树会像你我一样四处行走。甚至有人说，它们如今已经萌生了心智。传说夏·图尔拥有赋予万物灵性的力量……这难道只是巧合？"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6a594c9bc7263802c4181e4a525c2138e88b4a5a38455cd78568e653484bd2b7","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"7cd1bd9e9109ca585b5a1fd7b2efd1ac2989c8434d51aa074615d9dd807fceb5","logical_entry_identity":"d24d6c9bcbd79ca922599acd8b7c00afcc6e741fd947666d451cc86c92cb0a68","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"\nEncroaching terrain:\n%s%s","source_tag":"tformat","target":"\n前方地形：\n%s%s"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f6975cf8f2b0437102b51d180a1dadaff028472821ce13af66ba9e12896015c8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b85efca155ff8dfefecc356f22fdea6d5f25dc951e600bfa991fec0859d72da4","logical_entry_identity":"52746ba33b021b3b963f7d4ae94fe9f428234e6c1b173dc8a3cb6e84999d9639","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Gloom","source_tag":"talent name","target":"黑暗光环"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"07c1e8acb458435bc069865921fe7115887770c79af985eace919c81b892472d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b860c32a613d382ceb0c004a2dfdca32661397f24527891c624af098f0e9583b","logical_entry_identity":"55c25c905d3feaedbc31d92dd85e0678e2e9cf7f6548ef13572cc21179c671b4","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"second","source_tag":"_t","target":"秒"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"54ad5370cceba53a63fb5dfef1fdfa58fa24ad4f5c1407d86e8353eaf2210098","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b86428fc6d35e4e5668c4e34dc721b69d27e5a0e7e97968085fb966fba5e9ae1","logical_entry_identity":"358e5fb305487dd3a72a8514bc9e2b178aec3179fbc20b5d2359457839ea537f","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#{bold}##GOLD#You aren't so different...#LAST##{normal}#\n\nAs a sun paladin, you follow a code.  But with the darkness you've seen in the world, you've started to doubt.\n\nYou have unlocked the #LIGHT_GREEN#Fallen class evolution#WHITE# for Sun Paladins.\n\nLearn new Talents:#YELLOW#\n- Bloodstained: Make your foes bleed!\n- Darkside: Every light casts a shadow, yours is powerful indeed\n- Hatred: Manifest your hatred through bleeding\n- Dirges: Sing of death and sorrow to strength your resolve#WHITE#\n\nSwap your paladin Talents:#YELLOW#\n- Radiance turns into Gloom: Project onto others your own hate, hindering them\n- Crusader turns into Dark Sun: Call upon the energies of dead suns to crush your foes\n- Guardian turns into Crimson Templar: Use the power of blood to control and defeat the fools that oppose you\n#WHITE#\n\nClass evolutions are selected as prodigies and grant new ways to build and expand your class. They are only visible to the concerned class.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"#{bold}##GOLD#你和我们没什么两样……#LAST##{normal}#\n\n作为太阳骑士你遵守着行动准则。但在经历了世上的各种黑暗之后，你开始怀疑。\n\n你为太阳骑士解锁了#LIGHT_GREEN#堕落者职业进阶#WHITE#。\n\n学习新的技能：#YELLOW#\n- 血染：让敌人流血！\n- 背光面：有光的地方就有阴影，你的阴影格外强大。\n- 憎恨：通过流血显现你的憎恨。\n- 挽歌：悲伤和死亡之歌，强化你的意志。#WHITE#\n替换你的太阳骑士技能：#YELLOW#\n- 光辉转变为黑暗光环：将憎恨投射到他人身上，阻碍他们。\n- 十字军转变为无光之阳：呼唤死星的力量来粉碎你的敌人。\n- 守护转变为赤红守卫：使用鲜血的力量控制并打败那些反对你的愚民。\n#WHITE#\n\n职业进阶是一种觉醒技，它们可以给予你新的方法来强化你的职业。只有相关的职业才能看到它们。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"221dd61c2946001ecd5caecaa1208854b8653d0987c915645fbbeb46736f220d","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b86a488117ad0bb05a50c8daf7affb7d3fde8b87d75074ef39e2299021d132b1","logical_entry_identity":"4d2133a97ce394c931e4a25ecd94ea1f122ef5a7715c8e2ffb1c1e9c71625042","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"impervious","source_tag":"entity keyword","target":"密实"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"838c5f27c3794391cbbb802ad81f31989727d20f19fdce54d8c76f401c14c1ad","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b8705c23ca2b2bb8ee78298dcff6fde653710921e0a129f04928390c3cc6f79f","logical_entry_identity":"bda10a94f3114fa7d9e8c33c222973c42d1cb79584f894635b97d6c42d1aa0fc","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":", light","source_tag":"_t","target":", 光系"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8532a62d8983d13d20790f10b605dabf05a2a55338873c6651416351d98f224a","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b870f88964225fc1ba1a9d38a6bbbf2ea9cd4d8c2d9f2b45d790763d9799f458","logical_entry_identity":"9a6bf476637ebeab7ff4b26566b0affb1ab00fd64bd4811a74191d66873fe330","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"base","source_tag":"talent category","target":"基础"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b5ac04b8049e048ecbf63532e2e86684fdc3557b4f6d56bad352155a85b76f0c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b872fab348f8612fdb55f48c4071dea1a82ab96ec369b3dee4d00474385dbbc6","logical_entry_identity":"095457d55ff24d3b88dfade257d5e8f23d9befcee5dc13108872178599163cde","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"exit to the lost valley","source_tag":"entity name","target":"离开前往失落山谷"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"375262665970433754164b372b542f562a48c1f246f40d815e1aec3ddf9dac00","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b8735d0199ccf9098826c26d79723c6eecf417df6e23520c219cac80b467df29","logical_entry_identity":"7de5cb66e93d62c9c0f01a92673d390ee7449cabdedd2d320ed9ff4c16ec89e0","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"A radius %d pool of acid spawns at the target location, doing %0.1f Acid damage each turn for %d turns.\n\t\tAll creatures caught in the mire will also suffer a %d%% slowness effect.\n\t\tThe damage will increase with your Spellpower.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"一小块酸液覆盖了目标地面，散落在半径 %d 的范围内，每回合造成 %0.1f 点酸性伤害，持续 %d 回合。\n\t\t受影响的生物同时会减速 %d%%。\n\t\t伤害受法术强度加成。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"c04cf8a10ab688d327e6e5ca61b8910eb4bc312fb1d76030ba10f832048fe965","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b876f941447b1053d057d2fb42194bd1ce1c6d9f3ed59a34886c83c8108435b0","logical_entry_identity":"e010ffb753ac1f3bc8c713ef8fa2026b9d7a583c254a6ca5b51ba9ce6c64a784","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#GOLD##{bold}#Advanced Weapon Statistics#WHITE##{normal}#","source_tag":"_t","target":"#GOLD##{bold}#高级武器数据显示#WHITE##{normal}#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"8d25fcdac9c06afc30891d17c5f5157a926ec397b8fc3ff88389b3de25aa36fb","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b877eafa5d774fe84c35bb3a5015627a2dada2ef43c81b1f27ac6fa222240757","logical_entry_identity":"cbbcc798bc4076634bb1661945bdaf96cf9eee79ccc2dc087f57006861992a6b","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#VIOLET#%s loses 50 mana from using a non-Arcane talent!#LAST#","source_tag":"logSeen","target":"#VIOLET#%s 由于使用非奥术技能，流失了50点法力值！#LAST#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"18f79d3b13b3b74ad7d65428a4a0bc8f1ddcd6acde445595177a1fc3861e2d14","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b879292c6d811170ef8adbffe752ab4e03dc6f734d2cd3e9474c600d49db5f8