摧毁了？真抱歉我们刚见面时候我对你有点刻薄，不过修复时间线是件压力很大的事。\n我不能留在这里，我还有很多事情要做。带上这个，它也许会对你有帮助。\n#LIGHT_GREEN#*你刚想回答，他就又消失了。面前出现一道时空裂缝，希望是通往马基·埃亚尔的……*#WHITE#"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f415f5f9d91a4d7ebdc6b3cc6af693319b2e4c0dab1e68553dd826bc0545ea0c","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b89bfe77552abc787c995588bb928da4dff7f54df3b003971a60e8c22f46fd2c","logical_entry_identity":"059aaf6cf11f3b3d85fa0516130481daf2a56d35b34b165e58099df74ccce50d","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Left mouse click assigned","source_tag":"_t","target":"已设置为鼠标左键"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"160c9312ae0341b5600699487eabd66bc7c856930138642fd826482ab1fb9733","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b89d4535ca9e89ff80e27cd71f113fe13cf9109a0957844736b914710ef3ed42","logical_entry_identity":"cd11c96e43ee8f2227ac3624cc572438bd20eff1a4e6d2ad3415deee4d204b83","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"The target is afflicted with a magical poison and is suffering %0.2f arcane damage per turn.  All resistances are reduced by 10%%%s.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"目标被魔法毒素感染，每回合受到 %0.2f 奥术伤害，所有伤害抗性下降 10%% %s。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"82451c77f5f0609addfb68bd3ae2495a969a0d2713e0e1defef029a72dab8ca0","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b89f21081078b743cf32a9933d22909cc9d7993d7ea69ddc0174130c978e61d4","logical_entry_identity":"43e1008f8bb2f1c5433aa6f7047e5b72d47a2d318e3b13de8563510c4091543c","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You have obtained the three parts of the Staff of Telos and studied them carefully. You believe that you can merge them back into a single highly potent staff.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你已获得泰勒斯法杖的三个部件并仔细研究过。你相信自己能将它们重新合成为一根威力强大的法杖。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"828899e96e4a587a5ee6168ac5e455d402935da0900707dfa4a53c4a2b193550","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b8a25f8f62427668cc10f32ad5aef6055f06742a859118f4a1ccca28fd901689","logical_entry_identity":"a81c8b2b5575e5d4e19afdcccbbc9c8ae30711b303bfda19f44c7a8fe6f7bc95","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Armed with the knowledge of how important #GOLD#combat stats#WHITE# are, we now go in search of them. Yours are displayed in your character sheet. Once you've closed this window, you can open it and move your mouse cursor over them to see a brief description of what they do. The tooltip mentions some stuff we haven't covered yet, but we'll get there.\n\nSo what about seeing a monster's #GOLD#combat stats#WHITE#? This would hardly be a dungeon without creepy denizens; there's an orc ahead you can examine. Use the mouse or the 'l'ook command to examine that orc.\n","source_tag":"_t","target":"既然已经知道 #GOLD#战斗属性#WHITE# 有多重要，现在就来找找它们。你的属性显示在角色信息面板中。关闭此窗口后，你可以打开角色信息面板，把鼠标指针移到这些属性上，查看它们作用的简要说明。提示中会提到一些尚未讲到的内容，不过我们很快就会讲到。\n\n那么，怎样查看怪物的 #GOLD#战斗属性#WHITE# 呢？没有诡异住民可算不上地下城；前方有个兽人供你查看。使用鼠标或 l（查看）命令查看那个兽人。\n"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ae1e30aed23c36232e982d2318a96ec08f3807236d62c561d3aa5a360e9e76c7","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b8a819f8262fc200bf719bd7728610d3026c26e56764d428cbdf51ac7795aed6","logical_entry_identity":"cfd7275ac14585c68055354506cad9ba554b25ba29bb73a84e0953dc1201bff7","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"voratun torque","source_tag":"_t","target":"沃瑞钽项圈"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"3107aaad4cf12a1be66888a90bba220caed373cb1e4b38c66a667e1c22fe54a2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b8aa130023471970a6e1a612465acc03f439bf12d225c8088d18fdb58308ad6d","logical_entry_identity":"8965b514626202d2eb8e212ded44d0d37132d3b89e4dff84fac83a9f99a8c4b8","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Pfaugh. You're too late. %s has already finished. But I suppose it doesn't do any harm to take these and give you your undeserved reward.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"呸！你来太晚了。%s已经完成了。不过收下这些原料、把你不配得到的奖励给你，倒也没什么坏处。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"36c6b63e6a46680431d55ff8cd051154cd5df238a584c847fe94d02085e283a8","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"b8ac07630dde2584fa8a942a8